 (la)'=>'US West / Los Angeles (lah)','Asia / Singapore (sg)'=>'Asia / Singapore (sg)','Oceania / Sydney (syd)'=>'Oceania / Sydney (syd)','South America / Sao Paulo (br)'=>'South America / Sao Paulo (br)','Africa / Johannesburg (jh)'=>'Africa / Johannesburg (jh)','The primary storage region for your Storage Zone.'=>'The primary storage region for your Storage Zone.','CDN Pull Zone URL'=>'CDN Pull Zone URL','The URL of your CDN Pull Zone connected to this Storage Zone. Required for public image serving and signed URLs.'=>'The URL of your CDN Pull Zone connected to this Storage Zone. Required for public image serving and signed URLs.','Token Authentication Key'=>'Token Authentication Key','Found in Pull Zone &gt; Security &gt; Token Authentication. Required for signed/expiring URLs for full-resolution images.'=>'Found in Pull Zone &gt; Security &gt; Token Authentication. Required for signed/expiring URLs for full-resolution images.','File Management'=>'File Management','Scope'=>'Scope','Sunshine galleries only (recommended)'=>'Sunshine galleries only (recommended)','Entire WordPress site'=>'Entire WordPress site','Choose which images to offload to cloud storage'=>'Choose which images to offload to cloud storage','Remove local files after upload'=>'Remove local files after upload','<strong>Warning:</strong> This will permanently delete local copies after successful upload to cloud storage. Make sure your cloud storage is working properly before enabling this.'=>'<strong>Warning:</strong> This will permanently delete local copies after successful upload to cloud storage. Make sure your cloud storage is working properly before enabling this.','Bucket Path Options'=>'Bucket Path Options','Add Prefix to Bucket Path'=>'Add Prefix to Bucket Path','Groups media from this site together by using a common prefix in the bucket path of offloaded media files.'=>'Groups media from this site together by using a common prefix in the bucket path of offloaded media files.','Bucket Path Prefix'=>'Bucket Path Prefix','The prefix to add to all uploaded file paths (e.g., sunshine/)'=>'The prefix to add to all uploaded file paths (e.g., sunshine/)','Add Year & Month to Bucket Path'=>'Add Year & Month to Bucket Path','Provides another level of organization within the bucket by including the year & month in which the file was uploaded to the site.'=>'Provides another level of organisation within the bucket by including the year & month in which the file was uploaded to the site.','Add Object Version to Bucket Path'=>'Add Object Version to Bucket Path','Ensures the latest version of a media item gets delivered by adding a unique timestamp to the bucket path.'=>'Ensures the latest version of a media item gets delivered by adding a unique timestamp to the bucket path.','Please fill in all required fields (Storage Zone Password and Storage Zone Name)'=>'Please fill in all required fields (Storage Zone Password and Storage Zone Name)','Please fill in all required fields (Service Account JSON and Bucket Name)'=>'Please fill in all required fields (Service Account JSON and Bucket Name)','Please fill in all required fields (Access Key, Secret Key, and Bucket Name)'=>'Please fill in all required fields (Access Key, Secret Key, and Bucket Name)','Please select a storage provider first'=>'Please select a storage provider first','Bunny.net storage zones cannot be listed automatically. Please enter your Storage Zone name directly in the field above.'=>'Bunny.net storage zones cannot be listed automatically. Please enter your Storage Zone name directly in the field above.','Please enter your Service Account JSON key first'=>'Please enter your Service Account JSON key first','Please enter your Access Key and Secret Key first'=>'Please enter your Access Key and Secret Key first','Failed to connect. Please check your credentials.'=>'Failed to connect. Please check your credentials.','Failed to retrieve bucket list. Please check your credentials and permissions.'=>'Failed to retrieve bucket list. Please check your credentials and permissions.','No buckets found. Please create a bucket in your cloud storage provider first.'=>'No buckets found. Please create a bucket in your cloud storage provider first.','Cloud Storage Migration'=>'Cloud Storage Migration','Migrate existing gallery images to cloud storage'=>'Migrate existing gallery images to cloud storage','Start Migration'=>'Start Migration','View Migration Progress'=>'View Migration Progress','Cloud Storage is not configured. Please go to Settings > Cloud Storage to set up your account first.'=>'Cloud Storage is not configured. Please go to Settings > Cloud Storage to set up your account first.','WP Offload Media Detected:'=>'WP Offload Media Detected:','Found %1$s items offloaded via WP Offload Media. Run the %2$sWP Offload Media migration%3$s to convert this data into Sunshine\'s own storage. This is a one-time step that significantly improves frontend page load performance.'=>'Found %1$s items offloaded via WP Offload Media. Run the %2$sWP Offload Media migration%3$s to convert this data into Sunshine\'s own storage. This is a one-time step that significantly improves frontend page load performance.','Sunshine galleries only'=>'Sunshine galleries only','Migration Analysis'=>'Migration Analysis','<strong>Current Scope:</strong> %s (based on your Cloud Storage settings)'=>'<strong>Current Scope:</strong> %s (based on your Cloud Storage settings)','Change scope'=>'Change scope','All %d images are already in cloud storage. Nothing to migrate!'=>'All %d images are already in cloud storage. Nothing to migrate!','Total Images: %1$s | Already Offloaded: %2$s | Need to Offload: %3$s'=>'Total Images: %1$s | Already Offloaded: %2$s | Need to Offload: %3$s','Local Files Will Be Removed:'=>'Local Files Will Be Removed:','Your Cloud Storage settings are configured to remove local files after successful upload. Local copies will be permanently deleted once images are uploaded to cloud storage.'=>'Your Cloud Storage settings are configured to remove local files after successful upload. Local copies will be permanently deleted once images are uploaded to cloud storage.','Change this setting'=>'Change this setting','Local files will be kept after upload. To remove local files after migration, enable "Remove local files after upload" in your Cloud Storage settings.'=>'Local files will be kept after upload. To remove local files after migration, enable "Remove local files after upload" in your Cloud Storage settings.','Are you sure you want to start the migration? This will upload all images to cloud storage.'=>'Are you sure you want to start the migration? This will upload all images to cloud storage.','Starting migration...'=>'Starting migration...','Migration in progress'=>'Migration in progress','%d failed'=>'%d failed','Images are uploaded in the background. You can safely leave this page — the migration keeps running and you\'ll get an email when it finishes.'=>'Images are uploaded in the background. You can safely leave this page — the migration keeps running and you\'ll get an email when it finishes.','Stop Migration'=>'Stop Migration','failed'=>'failed','Are you sure you want to stop the migration? Images that have already been uploaded will remain in cloud storage, but the process will be cancelled.'=>'Are you sure you want to stop the migration? Images that have already been uploaded will remain in cloud storage, but the process will be cancelled.','Stopping...'=>'Stopping...','Failed to stop migration'=>'Failed to stop migration','Open in new tab to verify'=>'Open in new tab to verify','Migration Cancelled'=>'Migration Cancelled','Migration was stopped. %d images were successfully migrated before cancellation.'=>'Migration was stopped. %d images were successfully migrated before cancellation.','Migration Complete'=>'Migration Complete','Successfully migrated %d images to cloud storage!'=>'Successfully migrated %d images to cloud storage!','Migration completed with %1$d successful and %2$d failed uploads.'=>'Migration completed with %1$d successful and %2$d failed uploads.','Failed Images:'=>'Failed Images:','...and %d more'=>'... and %d more','Retry Failed Uploads'=>'Retry Failed Uploads','Clear Results'=>'Clear Results','Clear migration results?'=>'Clear migration results?','Retrying...'=>'Retrying...','Reclaim Local Storage is currently running. Let it finish before starting a migration.'=>'Reclaim Local Storage is currently running. Let it finish before starting a migration.','No images to migrate'=>'No images to migrate','Migration started'=>'Migration started','Migration stopped successfully'=>'Migration stopped successfully','No failed images to retry'=>'No failed images to retry','Reclaim Local Storage'=>'Reclaim Local Storage','Delete local copies of images that are already in cloud storage'=>'Delete local copies of images that are already in cloud storage','Find Reclaimable Files'=>'Find Reclaimable Files','View Cleanup Progress'=>'View Cleanup Progress','This tool finds images that are already in cloud storage but still have local copies on this server, then deletes the local files to free up disk space. Cloud copies are not touched — galleries continue serving from cloud storage.'=>'This tool finds images that are already in cloud storage but still have local copies on this server, then deletes the local files to free up disk space. Cloud copies are not touched — galleries continue serving from cloud storage.','No reclaimable files found. Every image in cloud storage has already had its local copy removed.'=>'No reclaimable files found. Every image in cloud storage has already had its local copy removed.','Found: %s redundant local files'=>'Found: %s redundant local files','Each local file is deleted only after its cloud copy is confirmed present and the correct size. Files that can\'t be verified are skipped.'=>'Each local file is deleted only after its cloud copy is confirmed present and the correct size. Files that can\'t be verified are skipped.','This action cannot be undone.'=>'This action cannot be undone.','Local files will be permanently deleted. Cloud copies remain in your bucket and galleries continue to serve from cloud storage.'=>'Local files will be permanently deleted. Cloud copies remain in your bucket and galleries continue to serve from cloud storage.','Start Cleanup'=>'Start Cleanup','Start cleanup? Local copies of images already in cloud storage will be permanently deleted.'=>'Start cleanup? Local copies of images already in cloud storage will be permanently deleted.','Starting...'=>'Starting...','Reclaiming local storage'=>'Reclaiming local storage','%d skipped (cloud copy not reachable)'=>'%d skipped (cloud copy not reachable)','Local files are deleted in the background. You can safely leave this page — the cleanup keeps running and you\'ll get an email when it finishes.'=>'Local files are deleted in the background. You can safely leave this page — the cleanup keeps running and you\'ll get an email when it finishes.','Stop Cleanup'=>'Stop Cleanup','skipped'=>'skipped','skipped (cloud copy not reachable)'=>'skipped (cloud copy not reachable)','Stop the cleanup? Files already deleted will not be restored.'=>'Stop the cleanup? Files already deleted will not be restored.','Cleanup Cancelled'=>'Cleanup Cancelled','Cleanup was stopped. %1$d local files were deleted (%2$s freed) before cancellation.'=>'Cleanup was stopped. %1$d local files were deleted (%2$s freed) before cancellation.','Cleanup Complete'=>'Cleanup Complete','Deleted %1$d local files and freed %2$s of disk space.'=>'Deleted %1$d local files and freed %2$s of disk space.','Deleted %1$d local files (%2$s freed). Skipped %3$d files where the cloud copy could not be verified.'=>'Deleted %1$d local files (%2$s freed). Skipped %3$d files where the cloud copy could not be verified.','Skipped Images:'=>'Skipped Images:','These images had cloud storage metadata but the cloud copy coul