itch from "Uniform" to "Fine-grained". Then re-run this test.'=>' Warning: Your GCS bucket uses uniform bucket-level access, which does not support per-object ACLs. Go to Cloud Console → Cloud Storage → Your Bucket → Permissions → Access Control → Switch from "Uniform" to "Fine-grained". Then re-run this test.',' Note: ACLs were automatically enabled on your bucket.'=>' Note: ACLs were automatically enabled on your bucket.',' Warning: Your S3 bucket does not support per-object ACLs. Go to S3 Console → Your Bucket → Permissions → Object Ownership → Edit → Select "ACLs enabled" with "Bucket owner preferred". Then re-run this test.'=>' Warning: Your S3 bucket does not support per-object ACLs. Go to S3 Console → Your Bucket → Permissions → Object Ownership → Edit → Select "ACLs enabled" with "Bucket owner preferred". Then re-run this test.',' Warning: Your bucket does not support per-object ACLs. Check your storage provider\'s documentation for enabling per-object ACLs, then re-run this test.'=>' Warning: Your bucket does not support per-object ACLs. Check your storage provider\'s documentation for enabling per-object ACLs, then re-run this test.',' Warning: Your bucket does not support per-object ACLs. Please enable ACLs in your storage provider settings, then re-run this test.'=>' Warning: Your bucket does not support per-object ACLs. Please enable ACLs in your storage provider settings, then re-run this test.','Your bucket is private, so images are served securely through signed URLs. This is the recommended setup for Backblaze B2 — no changes needed.'=>'Your bucket is private, so images are served securely through signed URLs. This is the recommended setup for Backblaze B2 — no changes needed.','Warning: Public URL access is blocked by your storage provider. All images will be served through signed URLs. Check your provider account settings to enable public object access for better performance.'=>'Warning: Public URL access is blocked by your storage provider. All i